# Git rules

- Fetch and branch from the current `origin/main`; the recorded migration
  baseline is the sole exception.
- End every changing turn with a meaningful commit and clean worktree.
- Never create empty commits or bypass hooks.
- Never attribute Cursor or an agent as author, committer, or co-author.
- Inspect `git log -1 --format='%an %ae%n%B'` after every commit.
